==Trivia==
While many cards in Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket reuse artwork from the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], this was the first of a small number of instances where the names of the originating card and the TCG Pocket card do not match; the illustration originates from a TCG card called {{TCG ID|VS|Morty's Gengar|21}}, while this card is simply called Gengar.

===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|VS|Morty's Gengar|21}} from the {{TCG|Pokémon VS}} expansion, which was only released in Japan.
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Gengar}}.
*'''Bother'''{{'}}s Japanese name is that of Disgust, an [[List of Abilities in Pokémon Conquest|Ability]] in [[Pokémon Conquest]], though Gengar cannot have it.
**As an attack in the TCG, it first appeared as '''Torment''' on {{TCG ID|Secret Wonders|Lombre|54}} from the {{TCG|Secret Wonders}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

